format 1

# Seeded by `pklith seed --init` from the fragments this repository's
# files switch on (`pklith detect`). It is yours now: pklith never rewrites it.
#
# No built-in check reads these types yet, so `pklith check` names them
# until each gets checks or an exempt reason: envrc, gitignore, lock.

## checks
id|category|nix|glob|check|fix|env|msg
# Overrides the catalog row: its globs miss the extension-less hook shims
# pklith seeds into .githooks/ (pklith overrides it the same way).
shellcheck|lint|shellcheck|.githooks/*, .envrc, **/*.sh|shellcheck --shell=bash {{files}}|-|-|shell script finding
# Not in pklith's catalog; ctrm comes from the flake (nix T24), as in
# actlith.
ctrm|lint|-|**/*|ctrm check {{files}}|ctrm fix {{files}}|-|a file holds a character its set does not grant; fix it, or grant it in .ctrm and say why in the commit
# rekall: agent prose and the rules extracted from it (nix T24).
rekall|lint|-|AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, rekall.toml|rekall check|-|-|agent prose drifted from the rules rekall extracted from it; run rekall scan and settle the drift
# xenolith: one language per file (nix T24), as in actlith.
xnl-check|lint|-|**/*.nix, **/*.pkl, .envrc, .githooks/*|xnl check {{files}}|-|-|a host file embeds a non-trivial program in another language; extract it with xnl extract
xnl-lint|lint|-|**/*.nix, **/*.pkl, .envrc, .githooks/*|xnl lint {{files}}|xnl lint --fix {{files}}|-|an embedded or extracted program fails its own language's linter
# The registry judges itself, as in pklith and actlith: generated steps
# match .pklith, and every tracked file type has a row.
gen-check|gate|-|.pklith, hk.pklith.pkl, nix/pklith.nix|pklith gen --check|pklith gen|-|hk.pklith.pkl or nix/pklith.nix no longer matches .pklith; run pklith gen
pklith-check|gate|-|-|pklith check|-|-|a tracked file type has no row in .pklith, a row matches nothing, or a claimed check never reaches its files

## types
type|checks|min|exempt
*|trailing-whitespace, final-newline, line-endings, no-bom, no-merge-conflict, no-case-conflict, no-broken-symlinks, no-private-key, ripsecrets, typos, editorconfig-checker, no-local-paths, ctrm|-|-
editorconfig|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
gitattributes|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
md|markdownlint|-|-
nix|nixfmt, statix, deadnix, xnl-check, xnl-lint|-|-
path:**/SPEC.md|markdownlint, mth-fmt, mth-check, sherd-check, sherd-nav, sherd-budget, itok|-|-
pklith|pklith-check, gen-check|-|-
pkl|xnl-check, xnl-lint|-|-
pre-commit|shellcheck, xnl-check, xnl-lint|-|-
pre-push|shellcheck, xnl-check, xnl-lint|-|-
commit-msg|shellcheck, xnl-check, xnl-lint|-|-
envrc|shellcheck, xnl-check, xnl-lint|-|-
sh|shellcheck, shfmt|-|-
toml|taplo|-|-
yaml|yamllint|-|-
gitignore|-|-|git configuration; hygiene steps only
markdownlintignore|-|-|markdownlint configuration; hygiene steps only
path:flake.lock|-|-|written by `nix flake lock`; hygiene steps only
context-limits|itok, sherd-budget|-|-
ctrm|-|-|ctrm configuration; hygiene steps only
ctrm-sets|-|-|ctrm configuration; hygiene steps only
path:AGENTS.md|markdownlint, rekall|-|-
path:rekall.toml|taplo, rekall|-|-
